      "source": [
        "You may compare it with the results we get from `lasso` and `ridge`.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Choosing number of components by cross-validation\n",
        "We use $K$-fold cross validation to find the best number of components. Our criterion is negative MSE."
      ],
